## Platform-Specific Code

Use conditional compilation for platform-specific features:
```vue
<!-- #ifdef H5 -->
<view>H5 specific</view>
<!-- #endif -->

<!-- #ifdef MP-WEIXIN -->
<view>WeChat MP specific</view>
<!-- #endif -->

<!-- #ifndef H5 -->
<view>All except H5</view>
<!-- #endif -->
```

In TypeScript:
```typescript
// #ifdef MP-WEIXIN
uni.getSystemInfo({
  success: (res) => {
    console.log('WeChat MP:', res)
  }
})
// #endif

// #ifdef H5
console.log('H5 platform')
// #endif
```
